# Files outside the CLI smoke runner: a glob, then the reason.
**/*.py       Host library sample; check against the Python/Polars package.
**/*.ts       Host library sample; check against the TypeScript package.
**/*.rb       Host library sample; check against the Ruby package.
**/*.R        Host library sample; check against the R package.
**/*.rs       Host library sample; check against the Rust crate.
**/*.c        Native sample; compile against the current C header.
**/*.sql      SQL sample; check against the matching installed extension.
**/*.sql.out  Saved output from a checked database sample.
